    {
      "heading": "Is it all harness engineering?",
      "text": "Harness engineering is one plausible answer. Cleaner state tracking, better memory, a more useful action interface and a disciplined reset policy could give the model better conditions to work in. Human experience may shape those choices: knowing what deserves attention can influence what the harness preserves and what it discards. The explanations can overlap. We would like to understand which decisions made a difference in Peter’s entry.",
